## Why This Is Asked
Tests fundamental cross-account trust, basic least privilege, and incident containment at beginner level.

## Key Concepts
- Cross-account IAM role and trust relationships
- S3 bucket policy and KMS encryption, per-tenant CMK
- Credential rotation and rapid containment

## Code Example
```json
// Trust policy snippet (tenant account -> analytics role)
{
  "Version": "2012-10-17",
  "Statement": [
    {
      "Effect": "Allow",
      "Principal": {"AWS": "arn:aws:iam::ANALYTICS_ACCOUNT_ID:role/TenantAnalyticsRole"},
      "Action": "sts:AssumeRole",
      "Condition": {"StringEquals": {"sts:ExternalId": "tenant-123-ext"}}
    }
  ]
}
```

```json
// Per-tenant bucket access policy (simplified)
{
  "Version": "2012-10-17",
  "Statement": [
    {
      "Effect": "Allow",
      "Action": ["s3:GetObject"],
      "Resource": "arn:aws:s3:::tenant-123-data/*",
      "Condition": {"StringEquals": {"aws:SourceArn": "arn:aws:iam::ANALYTICS_ACCOUNT_ID:user/tenant-123"}}
    }
  ]
}
```

## Follow-up Questions
- How would you extend this to handle 2+ tenants with minimal policy duplication?
- What monitoring would you add to detect misconfigurations or breaches?

## Why This Is Asked

This question tests practical, implementable security controls for multi-tenant data on AWS, focusing on least-privilege access, data at rest encryption, and rapid breach containment.

## Key Concepts

- STS AssumeRole with tenant-scoped attributes
- S3 bucket policy and per-tenant prefixes for isolation
- KMS per-tenant CMKs with rotation
- CloudTrail data events for auditability
- 60-second containment workflow to revoke credentials and quarantine tenant data

## Code Example

```json
{
  "Version": "2012-10-17",
  "Statement": [
    {
      "Effect": "Allow",
      "Action": ["s3:GetObject","s3:ListBucket"],
      "Resource": [
        "arn:aws:s3:::data-bucket",
        "arn:aws:s3:::data-bucket/tenant-${aws:PrincipalTag/tenant}/*"
      ],
      "Condition": {
        "StringEquals": {
          "s3:prefix": "tenant/${aws:PrincipalTag/tenant}"
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}
```

## Follow-up Questions

- How would you test the 60-second containment workflow in a live environment?
- Which logging and alerting signals validate immutable audit trails during containment?

